1. She enjoys eating toast with butter and caramel shortbread for breakfast. (Verbatim: "I had, I had, I had, I had toast with butter. Yay. Toast and butter. And a caramel shortbread.")

2. She drinks tea but often struggles with it being too hot to consume immediately. (Verbatim: "I've really wanted to drink from the tea. But it's too hot. I just can't drink it.")

